WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:07.420
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.130
Did the operation fail?

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:47.710
That fool.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.880
He couldn't even deal with the traitor,

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:52.370
\"Seven-Star Knives\" Lei En.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.910
Yeah. But he killed himself

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.240
and made the Forever-Spirit Knife

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:59.060
lose its power.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.980
He failed his mission.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:10.320
Should he

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:11.870
come back proudly?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:13.240
He deserves

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.440
his death.

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:18.420
Luckily, the Forever-Spirit Knife lost power,

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.780
one piece less of the legendary cookware.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.600
My Lord.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.110
If you send other men

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.630
for the legendary cookware,

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:30.100
please let me go.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.670
You don't need to do such things.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.560
To be frank,

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:34.860
we shouldn't

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.340
underestimate our opponents.

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.980
Are they really that good?

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:40.950
One of those in our way

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.580
is the Super Chef, Liu Maoxing.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.000
There's a long grudge

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.840
between us.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:52.210
Okay. You'll go this time.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:54.890
Thank you.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.470
Shanghai.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.710
They will be in Shanghai for sure.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.580
This time, we must get

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.410
the legendary cookware before them.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:16.020
Evil City Shanghai! The Dark Cooking Society Declares War!

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:25.450
(Shanghai)

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:32.150
Wait for me, Mao!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.380
This is Shanghai!

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.220
So crowded! I'm nervous.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.430
Guangzhou can’t compare with this.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.310
Crabs!

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.520
Shanghai crabs!

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:46.380
So good.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:47.970
Shrimps here!

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:50.260
And turtles.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.180
It's amazing.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:53.990
These guys are always like this.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.620
We can meet our foes

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.380
from the Dark Cooking Society at any time.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.950
Yet they don't worry at all.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.620
You bastard!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.400
Damn! How dare you!

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:05.930
The port here was just built.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:06.900
Good or not,

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.150
it's very lively.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.560
But then again,

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.310
in this metropolis,

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.850
the only clue to find the thousand-year cookware

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:16.830
is the cook league here.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.380
It’s way too difficult.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.040
The Shanghai Cook League?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:23.920
It’s said the league

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.840
is like the Guangzhou Cook League.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:27.750
It’s a cooking association.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.820
But they are better organized

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.500
and are more powerful

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.880
than the Guangzhou Cook League.

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:36.830
Let’s go. We don't have much time.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.190
The Dark Cooking Society

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:40.640
could have found them.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:58.550
What's the result?

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.960
The first stage of our plan is finished.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.100
The Shanghai Cook League

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.330
is now in chaos.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.970
Use the plan in Guangzhou once again.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.510
We must get

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.310
Shanghai’s cookware first,

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.210
to ensure our final plan succeeded.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:15.580
In terms of this,

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.750
we got the report that

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.000
the people from Yang Spring

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.950
have arrived in Shanghai this morning.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.120
They finally come.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.740
Okay. Prepare for the second stage.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:26.400
Yes.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.260
Lei En. Have you noticed it?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.020
We've got tails.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.300
These guys have come here.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:51.370
Probably.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:54.920
Okay. Let’s go.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.120
What are you doing?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.360
What’s going on, Lei En?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:07.870
What’s happening?

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:42.450
What do they want?

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:55.320
You... You brat!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.930
You are Lei En, the Seven-Star Knives!

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:58.270
The Dark!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:58.920
Yes!

00:06:58.970 --> 00:06:59.910
These guys are the Dark!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.260
Dark?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:10.790
Death!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:15.680
Death!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:20.750
Death!

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:25.810
Death!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:30.550
Death!

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:35.680
Death!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.860
No!

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.360
Execute them!

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:43.810
Wait!

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:51.180
They are not from the Dark Cooking Society.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.610
Sanjie

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.520
Mao. Meili.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:06.770
I was startled.

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:08.210
It’s been a while.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.850
Mao, you look good.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.130
You too.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:11.930
What?

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.210
Do you bring friends on your training journey?

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.150
You should’ve told me

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.240
that you’d come to Shanghai.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.150
Young Master.

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:20.780
Are they your friends?

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:22.230
Young Master.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.500
You jerk.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:25.200
Listen.

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:27.390
The boy in front of you

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.100
is the youngest Super Chef in history,

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.450
who is well-known in Guangzhou.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.340
(Super)

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:36.650
Liu Maoxing.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.160
Sorry for offending you.

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:47.270
So, you are Young Master’s savior.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.620
Thanks to him,

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.340
I could still stand here.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.020
Let’s talk later.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.350
Come. Let’s go to my restaurant.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:56.440
I’ll hold a reception banquet for you.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.350
I’ll go to the league myself.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.390
Wait, Lei En.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.080
Why don’t you join us?

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.420
(Longzhen Restaurant)

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.650
Longzhen Restaurant is

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.700
one of the few renowned old restaurants in Shanghai.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.320
The heir here

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.930
also studied in Yang Spring.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.120
Yes.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.750
Sanjie had a failure in his childhood.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:22.140
Then he couldn’t even hold a knife.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.700
He was depressed

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.450
and couldn’t do anything.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.610
It’s lame.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.400
I heard it, Meili.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.390
It doesn’t matter.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.710
That’s the truth.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.740
Fine. Thanks to Mao,

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:34.190
I can become

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:35.620
who I am today.

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:42.390
I gave up on my dream to be a chef,

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.840
but he helped me persist on it.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.600
Take it easy, Lei En.

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:48.690
We don't have time to catch up here.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:49.490
It’s fine.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.250
Mao.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:52.690
What?

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:54.380
What’s your purpose

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:55.870
to come to Shanghai?

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:02.090
The legendary cookware?

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:05.460
Are you looking for it too?

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:07.670
You said “too”.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.170
Have you also

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:10.860
heard about the legendary cookware?

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.230
To be honest,

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.460
the Shanghai cooking world

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:15.520
was in a mess

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.360
because of the legendary cookware.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.580
Each month,

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.710
the so-called Dark Cooking Society

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.360
writes letters to the league

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.530
and threatens them for the cookware.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.360
For this matter,

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:27.910
people get very nervous.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:30.930
That’s why

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.290
our men mistook you

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:32.950
as the guys

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:33.740
from the Dark Cooking Society.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.960
Haven’t they made any move yet?

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:38.990
It seems so.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.390
The officials of the league,

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.890
including my father,

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.530
are having a meeting at Huangpu River,

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:47.420
discussing how to fight back.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.440
I think they will work out a plan

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:51.140
or a solution.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.130
What is it?

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:09.160
It’s Elder Xinji from Jinjiang Restaurant.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.540
Shouldn't you be having the meeting?

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:15.540
Mao!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.140
Who are you?

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.420
This... This is...

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.260
The sign of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.350
Blackcloud Qilin.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.080
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:49.720
Young Master, what happened?

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.350
The officials of the league

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.500
are in my hands.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:56.360
What did you say?

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.660
And your father, Tang Sanjie.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:00.960
My father?

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:07.590
Why are you doing this?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:08.920
It's a declaration of war

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:10.000
from the Dark Cooking Society.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:11.780
A declaration of war?

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.510
Go get four chefs,

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:17.020
highly skilled ones.

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:17.970
Four?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:18.810
Why four?

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.420
The competition will be at midnight tonight,

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.850
at the boat on the Huangpu River.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:24.620
Liu Maoxing.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.630
Bring the maps on you.

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:27.690
Maps?

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.190
You should know.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:31.060
If you escape,

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.160
the officials of the league will die.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.630
Wait!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.420
It’s no use, Chef Xie.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:41.650
They challenged us

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.280
with a battle of cooking.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:46.050
Yes. We’ll compete by cooking.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:47.410
All right.

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:51.320
What are the maps she said?

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.000
In fact, before we set out...

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.850
The maps were entrusted to me

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.980
30 years ago

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.140
when I was assigned as

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.070
the manager of Forever-Spirit Knife.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.240
The saying has that it shows

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.180
where the legendary cookware was sealed.

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:10.730
As you see,

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.210
there is not a single word on the map.

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.210
So, the problem is,

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.530
we don’t know what it is

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.130
and where it is sealed.

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.720
We only know that

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.960
this is a map of Shanghai.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.710
Shanghai?

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.230
You must analyze this map

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:35.400
during your journey,

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.300
and find the legendary cookware one by one.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.070
It’s dangerous,

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.740
but someone must do it.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:42.530
It’s said

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:43.510
the legendary cookware

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.180
can connect with young souls.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.760
Only you, who have wisdom, courage

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.020
and

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.260
excellent souls of chefs,

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.130
can do it.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:03.960
I see.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:11.570
Didn’t she say four chefs?

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:15.090
Let’s go. Take me with you.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.140
We will be four chefs.

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.920
Moreover, they got my father.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:19.730
That will be good.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:20.280
Wait.

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.840
We don't know how good your cooking is.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.890
Your father got kidnapped,

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:28.520
but we can’t rashly take you

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:29.730
as the fourth chef.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:30.980
Why not?

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.130
Lei En is right.

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.540
Our opponent is from the Dark Cooking Society.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:35.720
If we are not careful,

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.190
we will lose our lives.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.920
You know it.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.990
We can’t afford to lose this battle.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:42.690
We can’t let them

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.420
have the cookware at any cost.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.570
We can't bring

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.020
an ordinary green hand with us.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.510
Ordinary?

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.000
Young Master is

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.470
the rising star in Shanghai’s cooking world.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.050
What do you want me to do?

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.130
Just show your ability.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.790
Cook something

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:58.460
that can

00:14:58.510 --> 00:14:59.720
convince us.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.310
We don't have time for that!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.680
Shut your mouth!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:05.250
I see.

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.080
What should I cook?

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.630
The ingredient will be that.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:26.910
Are you kidding?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.290
It’s damaged shark fin to be thrown away!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.390
How to cook

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.660
with the damaged shark fin?

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:34.730
It’s still shark fin anyway.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:36.090
Our opponents

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.980
may not compete fairly

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:38.480
with us.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.710
If you fail to

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.020
cook high-end dish with it,

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.740
we will not take you with us.

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:50.360
Sanjie.

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.170
Okay.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:13.440
Awesome.

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.130
Young Master.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:20.280
Great.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.710
It's amazing.

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:23.090
You are awesome.

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:30.940
What are you doing?

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:35.050
Lei En.

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:39.700
What... What are you doing?

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.570
Excellent knife skills.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:47.380
But cooking is much more than that.

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:48.630
I know.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.040
It’s done.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:21.950
So fast?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:23.590
Let me see.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.000
What is this?

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.500
This is sausage.

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:42.250
Sausage made from shark fin?

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:44.300
I’ve never seen this before.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.490
Please try it now.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.070
I’m gonna eat.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.640
I’m gonna eat.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:11.090
It’s a tornado!

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:14.520
It feels like a tornado in mouth!

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:19.420
Great.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:20.840
The bamboo shoots inside

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:21.750
are like tornados,

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.400
turning with excellent elasticity.

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.210
The taste of shark fin also spreads.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.060
The damaged shark fins

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.920
turn out to be so delicious.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:35.530
Yes.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.870
Wasn’t it damaged?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.560
Shark fin is actually tasteless,

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.510
but it can combine

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.250
with any kind of taste.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.380
The smoothness

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.600
makes it like high-end cuisine.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.700
A whole piece of shark fin is usually used.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:54.140
Boiling it without chopping will be good.

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:55.260
However,

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:56.390
the damaged shark fin

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:59.220
surprisingly has this taste.

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:14.720
You braided the shark fin, Jinhua Ham,

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.040
bamboo shoots together.

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:18.230
Right!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.850
It is braided,

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.210
so the sausage

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:24.310
can contain much more shark fin.

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:26.750
At the moment you bite it,

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:29.050
the braids unfold

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:29.990
like rubber bands,

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.140
and touch your mouth.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:34.550
The fish fin absorbed

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.150
the unique flavor of Jinhua Ham

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.060
and crisp bamboo shoots.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.350
It’s a kind of new taste.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:42.570
In terms of taste and creativity,

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.350
you are a match to Mao.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.360
You are no doubt qualified.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.920
That's great.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.860
That's great.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.630
That's great.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.710
Okay. Let’s go.

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:56.720
Wait and see.

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:58.500
I will defeat them with my own hands.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:15.840
Please come with me.

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:17.310
This man...

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:29.780
What?

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:38.100
Please wear these blindfolds.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.410
Blindfolds?

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.080
Just do as he said.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:47.440
Sit tight.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.170
Would they sell us abroad

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.230
by this way?

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.360
Don't talk nonsense.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:04.320
That could happen.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:05.380
Think about

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:06.660
who they are.

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:08.020
I have no idea

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.300
what kind of things they will do.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.300
You can take off blindfolds now.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.440
Have we arrived?

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.830
It’s dark here. I can't see anything.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:22.690
It feels like there’s something big.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:34.460
What... What is this?

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.130
A castle on this ship?

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.380
Is it the place of Dark Cooking Society

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:45.280
in the tales,

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:46.150
Loulin Palace?

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:49.430
(Loulin Palace)

00:23:14.809 --> 00:23:16.854
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.753 --> 00:23:18.938
This is a ship?

00:23:18.938 --> 00:23:21.077
We were surprised by the appearance of a huge ship,

00:23:21.077 --> 00:23:23.843
but the chef who appeared made us lose our voice.

00:23:24.288 --> 00:23:27.282
Instead of a knife, the chef used...

00:23:27.282 --> 00:23:28.668
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.956 --> 00:23:30.592
Huge Floating Cooking Arena!

00:23:30.592 --> 00:23:32.164
Magical Power of the Iron Arm Soup

00:23:32.164 --> 00:23:33.440
It will definitely be interesting!
